. Instead freely choose from hundreds of cards to combine them in interesting ways for diverse character build possibilities.\n\n•  Unlimited Character Customization - Create unique skills by combining different effects of the hundreds of available cards. Transform into a bear that spits out dozens of flaming arrows a second, or summon hounds that can summon even more hounds, or play as a spin-to-win warrior! \n\n•  Become the Dungeon Boss - Every 15 floors of the dungeon, there will be a dragon. Slay the dragon and you will become the Boss of that floor. You must then defeat your past characters to progress further into the dungeon.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/header.jpg?t=1720776964"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1720776964"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/ss_d65079f47f14869de5ad66c137086b637c22d34a.600x338.jpg?t=1720776964","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/ss_d65079f47f14869de5ad66c137086b637c22d34a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1720776964"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/ss_5936cb6d196768544b89b0745fdfea9e6f7a6a20.600x338.jpg?t=1720776964","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/ss_5936cb6d196768544b89b0745fdfea9e6f7a6a20.1920x1080.jpg?t=1720776964"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/ss_15d1fb2398425d987d647f21c8ae16fd168ff263.600x338.jpg?t=1720776964","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1711610/ss_15d1fb2398425d987d64